<!--
This file was recorded on an outer pixel ladder by Xiyang Wang during the charge injection
sequence. It records the data on the LVDS lines coming from the Mupix11 chips.
I (Mark Grimes) have stripped it down to only be the one log I've found that exercises the
firmware problem I know about. There was much more data in the original file but it didn't
show any errors.
I'm not sure if stripping this file means it can no longer be used with Quartus, but it can
be used in a cocotb testbench to test the firmware issue.
-->
